ghost-role-information-aborigine-rules = You are a Wild Lands tribal aborigine. Defend your land against Wey-Yu and invaders. Cooperate with your tribe. Do not abandon the planet without reason.

ghost-role-information-aborigine-chieftain-name = Wild Lands Chieftain
ghost-role-information-aborigine-chieftain-description = Leader of the tribe. Huge health, War Cry clears stuns from allies. Lead the charge on Wey-Yu.

ghost-role-information-aborigine-medic-name = Wild Lands Medic
ghost-role-information-aborigine-medic-description = Tribal shaman. Psi-Heal, Psi-Regen and Psi-Resurrect for the tribe. Standing on Oskarrr moss fully restores your psi energy.

ghost-role-information-aborigine-stalker-name = Wild Lands Stalker
ghost-role-information-aborigine-stalker-description = Jungle hunter. Blend into tall grass and moss. Poisoned arrows and darts slow prey.

ghost-role-information-aborigine-warrior-name = Wild Lands Warrior
ghost-role-information-aborigine-warrior-description = Rank-and-file fighter. Fast on dirt and sand, immune to thicket slowdown. Clubs and spears.

aborigine-warcry = WAR CRY!
aborigine-warcry-rally = The chieftain's cry clears your head!
aborigine-psi-no-energy = Not enough psi energy.
aborigine-psi-heal = Psi aura heals {$count} tribe members.
aborigine-psi-regen = Psi regeneration surrounds {$count} tribe members.
aborigine-psi-resurrect = You pull a tribe member back from death.
aborigine-psi-resurrect-target = Shamanic energy forces you awake!
aborigine-psi-resurrect-not-dead = They are not dead.
aborigine-psi-resurrect-not-tribe = Only tribe members can be resurrected.
aborigine-psi-resurrect-far = Too far away.
aborigine-psi-resurrect-fail = This body cannot be revived.
